OL,3,GNEWSAFrom table tennis to travel: How  
OL,4,Acouple kept their love alive for 70    
OL,5,Ayears                                  
OL,7,FColin and Carol Hill's love story began
OL,8,Fon the dance floor more than 70 years  
OL,9,Fago. Now in their nineties, they still 
OL,10,Fplay table tennis and attend keep-fit  
OL,11,Fclasses, and say staying active has    
OL,12,Fhelped keep their romance alive.       
OL,14,FColin, 91, and Carol, 90, from         
OL,15,FCleveleys, married two years after     
OL,16,Fmeeting at the historic Hill Stores    
OL,17,FBallroom in Oldham in 1954.            
OL,19,FColin walked Carol home after their    
OL,20,Ffirst dance and declared he was going  
OL,21,Fto marry her. Her response was simple: 
OL,22,F"No way."                              
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
