OL,3,GNEWSAFrom table tennis to travel: How  
OL,4,Acouple kept their love alive for 70    
OL,5,Ayears                                  
OL,7,FHowever, Colin won her over and, more  
OL,8,Fthan seven decades later, the couple   
OL,9,Fsay they are as much in love now as    
OL,10,Fthey were as newlyweds.                
